Homepage: https://github.com/Noronus/neomixer
Description: Virtual audio mixer for PipeWire, with an EQ on every channel
 A virtual audio mixer for PipeWire with Voicemeeter's workflow: channel strips, A/B routing,
 a parametric EQ on every channel, and programs that stay where you put them. A fork of
 Pulsemeeter.
